<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman '96 view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman '96 view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Brown Brothers Harriman analyst Raphael Soifer said he raised his fiscal 1996 earnings estimate for Lehman brothers Holdings Inc to $2.95 per share from $2.80</p>
<p>-- Analyst said increase in earnings forecast reflects better-than-expected FY Q3 result of $0.60/shr, an increase in FY Q4 estimate to $0.67 from $0.61</p>
<p>-- Analyst maintains FY 1997 estimate of $3.30/shr</p>
<p>-- Stock remains market perform/hold</p>
</text>
